    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40315" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινέω</span></b>  (B), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heap upon</i>, 
